+-   - PAL / VaR / loss caps.
+-4. For index ladders specifically:
+-   - Default to **maker-only**, 1-lot, ≤2 bins per market.
+-   - Respect fee schedule for indices.
+-   - Never ship code that silently flips to taker without an explicit CLI flag.
+-
